{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>《魷魚遊戲》是一部韓國成人向劇集，相關摘要將其形容為芒果TV劇集陣容中成績突出的作品。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《魷魚遊戲》主創黃東赫表示願意繼續製作新一季\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261120/1795162724_283390_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>該劇在2021年至2025年間共推出三季。黃東赫此次表態為繼續創作保留了可能性，但採訪中的具體條件尚不明確。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《魷魚遊戲》主創黃東赫表示願意繼續製作新一季\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261120/1795162727_195369_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>目前尚無更具體的後續計劃，是否會推出新一季仍需等待正式消息。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《魷魚遊戲》主創黃東赫表示願意繼續製作新一季\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261120/1795162722_595133_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《魷魚遊戲》主創黃東赫表示願意繼續製作新一季\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261120/1795162724_283390_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《魷魚遊戲》主創黃東赫表示願意繼續製作新一季\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261120/1795162727_195369_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:04:02.284961+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":5,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:33:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T15:57:21.497584+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:57:18.311935+00:00","content_hash":"7093c8fed16412b2782d3a2049c8714d4d32af0e30e7e0aba68c358d332e3421","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}